import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
---

<Page title="Terms of use – Fettle, London" description="The plain understanding between us when you use this site and work with Fettle.">
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="wrap">
        <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
        <h1>Terms of use</h1>
        <p class="lede">The plain understanding between us when you use this site and work with Fettle.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page-body">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="prose">
          <p class="muted">Last updated 2 July 2026.</p>

          <h2>About this site</h2>
          <p>This site describes what Fettle does and lets you check whether we have room on our list. Prices shown &ndash; such as &ldquo;from &pound;90&rdquo; for a half-day &ndash; an introductory rate for our first clients &ndash; are a guide. A first visit to see the job and give you a price is &pound;30, and your actual quote for the work comes after that visit, once we&rsquo;ve seen it.</p>

          <h2>Booking work</h2>
          <p>Checking availability or getting in touch isn&rsquo;t a booking. A job is agreed only once we&rsquo;ve visited, given you a price, and you&rsquo;ve said yes. We take on a limited number of homes, so a slot near you isn&rsquo;t guaranteed.</p>

          <h2>Our work</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>We do the work with reasonable care and skill, and leave a tidy finish.</li>
            <li>Licensed trades &ndash; plumbing, rendering, tree surgery &ndash; are carried out by vetted specialists.</li>
            <li>If something isn&rsquo;t right, tell us and we&rsquo;ll put it right.</li>
          </ul>

          <h2>Payment</h2>
          <p>The &pound;30 visit fee is deducted from your invoice if you go ahead with the work at that visit, so there&rsquo;s no call-out fee on top. We invoice for the half-day or full-day agreed, plus any materials. Terms are set out on your quote.</p>

          <h2>This content</h2>
          <p>The words, marks, and images on this site belong to Fettle. Please don&rsquo;t reuse them without asking.</p>

          <hr class="divider" />
          <p class="muted">Need the detail on a specific job? <a href="/contact">Talk to us</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
</Page>
